<title>FINLAND: STOCKMANN MAY SALES UP 6 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>STOCKMANN MAY SALES UP 6 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Oy Stockmann Ab said in a statement on Tuesday that group sales had increased 5.9 percent year-on-year in May to 711.7 million markka from 672.2 million.</p>
<p>In January-May, Stockmann's sales rose 13 percent to 3,357.6 million from 2,967.6 million.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
